DETAIL:  Key (code)=(1) already exists.
HINT:  Another enabled sector already has the same code (the digits of the path). Give this sector a path whose digits differ.
CONTEXT:  PL/pgSQL function admin.sector_custom_only_upsert() line 64 at RAISE
COPY sector_custom_only, line 9: "s1,"er ror,part2 ",desc works"
